OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain and strong winds
OL,6,Fwill move in from the west on Sunday
OL,7,Fwith coastal gales developing. Rain
OL,8,Fwill turn showery across the south,
OL,9,Fwith some warm bright spells in the
OL,10,Fsoutheast. Heavy downpours and
OL,11,Fblustery winds likely at times.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain will clear this evening,
OL,14,Ffollowed by a largely fine night with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Aside from a few sharp
OL,16,Fshowers in western Scotland,
OL,17,Fconditions will remain dry. Turning
OL,18,Fchilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
