OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA chilly start on Monday
OL,6,Fmorning, followed by a fine day with
OL,7,Fprolonged sunny spells. Further
OL,8,Fblustery showers in western Scotland,
OL,9,Fand a chance of evening rain in the
OL,10,Fsoutheast.
